          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 4: Folio 3v, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a\u0304h\u032eir k\u0323a\u02bfdede sehv-i</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>secde ide. Vitir&rsquo;de</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323unu\u0304t du\u02bfa\u0304s\u0131n\u0131 unutsa,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sehv-i secde ide.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Do\u0308rt rek\u02bfat olan</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>farz\u0307larda iki evvelki</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>rek\u02bfat\u0131nda Fa\u0304tih\u0323ay\u0131 ve</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>su\u0304reyi (bottom left)</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
