      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 4: Folio 3v, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>in the last qa\u02bfda, your prayer is invalid.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If, during the witr prayer,</p>\n</li>\n<li>you forget to say the&nbsp;&lsquo;qunu\u0304t&rsquo; prayer,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>your prayer is invalid.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If, during the first two rak\u02bfas in</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[one of the three] four-rak\u02bfa obligatory prayers,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>you leave out both the Fa\u0304tih\u0323a and</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the chapter (bottom left)</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
